<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWA ICHANDUSO LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc2">1TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tim.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWA ICHANDUSO LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha ichanduso cha Timoteo kicho lupwilili lwandikigwe na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Paulo ha mwanahina wake Timoteo. Kitabu cha ichanduso cha Timoteo yodahika kamba chandikigwa mkipigiti cha milao ya 62-64 songela viyavumbuke Kilisto. Mbuli ino ikala behi na ikimambukizo cha ugima wa Paulo. Paulo kakala yamnogele ng'hani Timoteo, na mianza bwando kamkema kamba mwanage (Flp. 2:22 na 1Tim. 1:2, 1:18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Luno lulo lupwilili lumwe mmwanza wa mhwilili nne zayandike Paulo ha munhu imweimwe uhaleka zija zayandike ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto. Mhwilili ndatu ziyagwe zizo lupwilili lwa ikabili lwa Timoteo, lupwilili lwa Tito, na lupwilili lwa Filimoni. Kitabu cha ichanduso cha Timoteo kimema ndagizi bwando za nhambiko ya wanhu wamtogole Kilisto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 2:1-15">2:1-15</ref></char>), vivija vilangizi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto viwolondigwa kuwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 3:1-13">3:1-13</ref></char>), na nzuma za mbuli ya wakulufunzi wa uvwizi (<char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-11">1:3-11</ref>, </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-5">4:1-5</ref>, </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 6:3-5">6:3-5</ref></char>). Mbuli ino yolagusa vija Paulo viyamfundize Timoteo kuwa kilangizi mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto. Kitabu cha ichanduso cha Timoteo kimema malagizo bwando gondagawataze vilangizi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wa mazua gano kutenda sang'hano za wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali hasi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo kosonga na kumulamsa Timoteo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho komzuma Timoteo yaiteganye na wakulufunzi wa uvwizi (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-11">1:3-11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Paulo kogendelela kusimulila vija voyolava hewela sama ya Yesu Kilisto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:12-20">1:12-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abaho komfundiza Timoteo mmbuli ya kutambika na vilangizi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 2-3">2—3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Paulo komambukiza lupwilili lwake mkumgwelela Timoteo ndagizi za kimambukizo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 4-6">4—6</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo, mtumigwa wa Yesu Kilisto, yasaguligwe na manogelwa ga Mulungu Mkombola wetu na Kilisto Yesu tamanilo jetu.<verse eid="1TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>Nokwandikila gweye, Timoteo, mwanangu wa ikweli mnhamanila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Ngekewa, bazi, na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata na kulawa ha Kilisto Yesu Mndewa wetu viwe hamoja nagwe.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzuma za Mafundo ga Uvwizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Kamba vinikuyalalile vinikalile mnzila nichola muisi ya Makedonia, usigale mdiwambo da Efeso, kwavija kuna wanhu haja wofundiza mafundo ga uvwizi, avo uwagomese. <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Walongele waleke sheha na misululu mitali ya wahenga ilibule nziga vigala bamila. Mbuli zino hazimtaza munhu kutenda sang'hano ya Mulungu zitendeka kubitila nhamanila iiyeka. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Kilamso cha ndagizi ino kicho kamba wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto wamemezigwe na noge dija dilawa mmoyo unogile, udaho ung'alile wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, na nhamanila ilibule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Wakulufunzi wano wa uvwizi waga kulawa mzimbuli zino na kugalukila ulonzi ulibule kinhu. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Wolonda kuwa wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, ila hawagatanga gaja gowolonga ama mbuli zija zowogangamiza.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Tovitanga kamba Malagizo ga Musa ganoga ihawa munhu kogasang'hanikila viilondigwa. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Vivija tovitanga kamba Malagizo ga Musa hagekigwe sama ya wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye, ila sama ya wakeng'enha Malagizo gano na watenda mbuli zihile, wamhazi na wene vilozo, wanyolodoke na walekile kumtanga Mulungu, sama ya waja wose wowakoma tata zao ama mama zao, sama ya wakomaji, <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>wagoni, wambigalo wowasa na wambigalo wayao, wachuluzi wa nyakadala, wavwizi, woiduila uvwizi, ama waja wose wotenda kinhu chochose kilekile kuilinga na mafundizo ga ikweli, <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>golawa Muusenga Unogile wa yenzi ya Mulungu unigweleligwe nie.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bazi da Mndewa ha Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Nomgwelela hewela Kilisto Yesu Mndewa wetu, ayo yanigwelele mhiko sama ya sang'hano yangu. Nomgwelela hewela kwavija kanyona nie kamba nabule uzenzeleganye na kanisagula nie sama ya sang'hano yake, <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>hata kamba umwaka nikala nimfukulila na kumgaza na kumuliga. Ila sambi kanyonela bazi kwavija nitenda hivo bila kuvitanga, na nikala ning'hali sinakwika nhamanila yangu kumwake. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Ngekewa bwando za Mndewa wetu zitigwa kumwangu na kanitenda nie nimtogole heyo na kuwanogela wanhu wayagwe kwavija nie niilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Ulonzi uno uwa kweli na wolondigwa kutogoligwa, kamba “Kilisto Yesu keza muulumwengu kuwakombola wene vilozo,” na nie niloza ng'hani kubanza wose. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Ila Mulungu kanyonela bazi, giladi kubitila nie, nilozile ng'hani kubanza wose, Kilisto Yesu yalaguse mwazaganyo wake ulibule nziga kamba kilingilo ha wanhu waja wondawamtogole na kubokela ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Ha Mndewa wa digunge, yalibule nziga, yoleka koneka, yali Mulungu yeiyeka, yenzi na hishima viwe kumwake milongo yose. Amina.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Mwanangu, Timoteo, nokugwelela ndagizi zino kamba vija mbuli za uhokozi zihokoligwe umwaka zikulonga gweye, giladi mkuziwinza mbuli hizo udahe kugomba ngomba inogile, <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>mkuzigoga nhamanila na udaho ung'alile wa kusambula gehile na ganogile. Ila wanhu wayagwe waulema udaho wao wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, avo wayagiza nhamanila yao. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Mmwanza wao wakala Himenayo na Alekizanda, niwalavile ha Mwenembago giladi wafundizigwe waleke kumfukulila Mulungu.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Avo, mzimbuli zose, nowayalalila kamba kupula, kutambika, kuwatambikila wanhu wayagwe, na kulava hewela vitendeke sama ya wanhu wose, <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>sama ya wandewa, na waja wose wali na udaho, giladi tukale mditindiwalo na bila kugomba mkumnogela Mulungu na ung'azi. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Nhambiko kamba ino inoga, na imnogeza Mulungu Mkombola wetu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>ayo yolonda wanhu wose wakomboligwe na wapate kuitanga ikweli. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Kwavija hana Mulungu imwe, na hana imwe yodaha kuwalumba wanhu wose hamoja na Mulungu, nayo iyo Kilisto Yesu, <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>ayo yaulavile ugima wake giladi yawakombole wanhu wose. Mbuli ino ilavigwa usindila mkipigiti kilondigwe. <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>Kino kicho kilamso cha Kilisto kunisagula nie kuwa mtumigwa wake giladi niupete Usenga Unogile na kuifundiza nhamanila ya ikweli ha Wamhazi. Sivwiza, ila nolonga ikweli.<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Hanhu hohose hawaiting'hane wanhu wamtogole Kilisto nolonda wambigalo watambike, wambigalo wekigwe mmakono ga Mulungu wadahe kwinula makono gao mkutambika bila lusango ama kuibamilila. <verse eid="1TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/>Vivija nolonda watwanzi wavale vinogile na kwa hishima, wavale vivalo vilondigwa kuvaligwa na watwanzi, sio mkukutika mvili za hela bwando ama kuvala zahabu ama lulu ama vivalo va hela bwando <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>ila na sang'hano zinogile, kamba viilondeka na watwanzi watogole kumtambikila Mulungu. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Mtwanzi kolondigwa yaifundize kunyamala na kuwa na moyo wa kuihumulusa. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Simtogoza mtwanzi kufundiza ama kuwa na udaho kwa mbigalo. Mtwanzi kolondigwa yanyamale. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Kwavija Adamu iyo yasongile kuumbigwa, abaho Hawa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Adamu sio iyo yavwiziligwe. Ila mtwanzi iyo yavwiziligwe na kugaluka munhu yali na vilozo. <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Ila Mulungu kowakombola watwanzi kulawa m'vilozo vao kubitila kulela wana, ihawa wogendelela kukala mnhamanila, mdinoge, muung'azi, hamoja na kuleka kuigoda.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Vilangizi wa Wanhu Wamtogole Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Ulonzi uno uwa kweli, kamba munhu yahalonda kuwa kilangizi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, kosulukila sang'hano inogile. <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Avo kilangizi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto kolondigwa sambiyawe na mbuli na munhu, yawe mbigalo wa mtwanzi imwe, yadahe kukiizuila, yakiitawale mwenyego, yahishimilwe. Kolondigwa yawabokele wahenza mng'anda yake, na yadahe kufundiza. <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>Sambiyakoligwe na divai, sambiyawe munhu wa kufafalika, ila yawe munhu yaholile, sambiyawe na kiyahiyahi, ama munhu wa kunogela hela. <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>Kolondigwa yaichunge goya ng'anda yake na kona kamba wanage womtegeleza na hishima ilondigwa. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Ihawa munhu havitanga vija viyolondigwa kuichunga goya ng'anda yake, kodahaze kuwachunga wanhu wamtogole Kilisto? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Sambiyawe munhu yamtogole Kilisto mkipigiti kiguhi, giladi sambiyaitope na kugwila mnhaguso ija yondayaibokele Mwenembago. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Vivija kolondigwa yawe na nhogolwa inogile na wanhu wa kunze, giladi sambiyawe na mbuli na munhu na kugwila mumtego uja Mwenembago uyawikile sama ya kuwanamata wanhu kipigiti vondayawageze.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mashemasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Vivija na mashemasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mashemasi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wanhu wosang'hanika mdidale da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.</char></note> wawe wanhu wa kuhishimilwa, sambiwawe videlenya, sambiwakoligwe na divai, ama sambiwanogelwe na hela ya uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>Wolondigwa kuigoga ng'hani ikweli ya nhamanila na udaho ung'alile wa kusambula gehile na ganogile. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Tanhu wolondigwa wagezigwe, na wahakoneka kamba wabule mbuli zihile, wasang'hanike kamba mashemasi. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Vivija na watwanzi zao,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wasomi wayagwe wogelegeza kamba </char><char style="fk" closed="false">watwanzi zao </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wakala wasang'hana wa kitwanzi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.</char></note> wolondigwa wawe watwanzi wohishimilwa, sambiwawalonge wanhu vihile, ila wadahe kukiizuila na kuwa bule uzenzeleganye mzimbuli zose. <verse eid="1TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Shemasi kolondigwa yawe mbigalo wa mtwanzi imwe, na kolondigwa yawachunge goya wanage na wanhu wa mng'anda yake. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Waja wasang'hanike goya kamba mashemasi wopata nhogolwa inogile ng'hani na wodaha kulonga bila kidumbo mnhamanila yao mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyong'onyo Ng'hulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Notamanila kwiza kumwako sambisambi. Ila nokwandika ndagizi zino giladi <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>kamba nihakawa, uvitange vija wanhu wali mng'anda ya Mulungu viwolondigwa kuwa, awo wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, wanhu wa Mulungu yali na ugima, awo wali nguzo na msingi wa ikweli. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Bila kudungwadungwa mmoyo, kija kifisigwe mnhamanila yetu kikulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kagubuligwa mulukuli lwa kiunhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">kapetigwa na Loho wa Mulungu kamba kabule uzenzeleganye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">na koneka na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kapetigwa hagatigati ya Wamhazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">katogoligwa muulumwengu wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">na kasoligwa uchana muna iyenzi.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Wakulufunzi wa Uvwizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Loho wa Mulungu kolonga bila kifiso kamba mkipigiti cha kimambukizo wanhu wayagwe woilema nhamanila na kuwinza loho za uvwizi na mafundizo golawa ha vinyamkela. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Mafundizo kamba higo gabwililiswa na videlenya na wavwizi, wali na udaho udanganhike wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, kamba usomigwe na zuma da moto. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Wowagomesa wanhu sambiwasole na kuwalagiza kamba sambiwaje mandia gayagwe, mandia gaja Mulungu yagalumbile giladi gabokeligwe mkulava hewela na waja wotogola na kuitanga ikweli. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Kwavija kila kinhu kilumbigwe na Mulungu kinoga, kuduhu kinhu chochose kilemigwa ihawa kibokeligwa mkulava hewela, <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>kwavija king'alizwa na usenga wa Mulungu na mkutambika.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Msang'hana Yanogile wa Kilisto Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Kamba uhawalagiza wanhu wamtogole Kilisto mbuli zino, kowa msang'hana yanogile wa Kilisto Yesu, ufundizigwe goya mmbuli ya usenga wa nhamanila na mafundizo ganogile gaja gaugawinzile. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Sambiugaye na usheha wa kimhazi na simulizi za uvwizi zilibule kinhu. Ila uifunze mwenyego kuwa munhu yomnogela Mulungu. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Kwavija lukuli luhasang'hanika losamhuka, ila sang'hano ya kumtanga Mulungu inoga ng'hani mzimbuli zose, mkukigoga kilagano sama ya ugima wa kipigiti kino na ugima wa kipigiti kikwiza. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Ulonzi uno uwa kweli na wolondigwa kutogoligwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Kino kicho kilamso cha tweye kusang'hanika ng'hani na kugendelela kuiyoha, kwavija twika tamanilo jetu ha Mulungu yali na ugima, ayo yali Mkombola wa wanhu wose, na ng'haning'hani waja womtogola.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Mbuli zino uzilagize na kuzifundiza. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Munhu yoyose sambiyaubeze umhale wako, ila sang'hano zako zoneke zinoga hameso ga wanhu wamtogole Kilisto muulonzi, muukazi, mdinoge, mnhamanila, na muung'azi. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Iyohe kuzisoma Nyandiko Zing'alile ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, giladi uwazume na kuwafundiza mbaka kipigiti vondanize. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Sambiuileke nhunza yako iugweleligwe kubitila usenga wa kihokozi kipigiti wavyele viwakwikile makono gao. <verse eid="1TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Ugangamale ng'hani mzimbuli zino, na uzisang'hane giladi wanhu wose wone vija vuigendeleza nhunza yako. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Uichunge mwenyego na mafundizo gako. Zigoge ng'hani mbuli hizo, kwavija ihawa kozisang'hana, kokiikombola gweye mwenyego na waja wokutegeleza.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Viilondigwa Kuwatendela Wanhu Wamtogole Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Sambiumkomhokele m'vyele, ila muyalalile kamba vija yahawile tataako mwenyego. Watendele ganogile wamhale kamba ndugu zako mwenyego, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>watwanzi wavyele kamba mama zako, na wandele kamba lumbu zako, na ung'azi wose.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Wahishimile vizuka awo walibule wanhu wa kuwatamanila. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Ila kamba kizuka kana wana ama wazukulu, tanhu wolondigwa kuifunza kumsang'hanikila Mulungu mkuwatendela ganogile wanhu wa mulango wao wenyego, na mkutenda vino wowaliha watata na wamama zao na wavyele zao, kwavija vino vivo vimnogela Mulungu. <verse eid="1TI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Mtwanzi ayo yali kizuka kweli, yalekigwe yeiyeka, kokwika tamanilo jake ha Mulungu na kugendelela kutambika imisi na ikilo na kumpula Mulungu giladi yamtaze. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Ila kizuka yokala sama ya kunogela mbuli zihile kadanganhika hata kamba yahawa mgima. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Wagwelele wanhu ndagizi zino giladi munhu yoyose sambiyawe na mbuli na munhu. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Ila kamba munhu yoyose yoleka kuwagwelela ndugu zake vinhu vowolonda, na ng'haning'hani waja wali mmulango wake, kaibela nhamanila na munhu ayo keha ng'hani kubanza Mmhazi.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Sambiumwike kizuka mumsululu wa vizuka kamba hanavikila milao malongo sita, na yakalile yasoligwe mwanza umwe. <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>Yawe kotangigwa goya sama ya sang'hano zinogile, kamba kulela wana, kuwabokela wanhu, kuwasuluza magulu ga wanhu wa Mulungu, kuwataza wanhu wali na migayo, na kukiilava mwenyego kwa namna zose kutenda sang'hano zinogile.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Ila vizuka wandele sambiuwagele mumsululu wa vizuka. Kwavija sulukila zao za lukuli zihabanza ng'hani kubanza kumsang'hanikila Kilisto, wolonda kusoligwa kabili. <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>Avo wokiigalila nhaguso wenyego, kwavija wakibena kilagano chao cha mwanduso. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Vivija wokiifundiza kuwa wakoka na kwanga kulawa kae ino na kwingila kae iyagwe. Na hawawa tu wakoka, ila wodeta na kusimulila mbuli za wanhu, mkulonga mbuli zija hawalondeke kuzilonga. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Avo nihanogelwe vizuka wandele wasoligwe, walele wana, na kuzichunga goya kae zao giladi mdumuka wao sambiyapate hanhu ha kulonga vihile. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Kwavija vizuka wandele wayagwe wahinduka wesha na kumuwinza Mwenembago. <verse eid="1TI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Ila kamba mtwanzi yoyose yamtogole Kilisto yahawa na vizuka mmulango wake, kolondigwa yawataze mwenyego giladi wanhu wamtogole Kilisto sambiwadonhezwe. Wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wolondigwa wadahe kuwataza vizuka awo wali vizuka wa ikweli.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Wavyele awo wozilongoza goya sang'hano za wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wolondigwa kubokela kitumetume mianza mibili, ng'haning'hani waja wotenda sang'hano ya kuupeta Usenga Unogile na kufundiza. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>Kwavija Nyandiko Zing'alile zolonga, “sambiumfunge ng'ombe mulomo kipigiti yahahugusa muhindi mkuubojaga,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 25:4</ref></char>.</note> na “Wasang'hana wolondigwa wagweleligwe kitumetume chao.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:7">LUKA 10:7</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1TI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Sambiutogole kubokela nhaguso imtagusa m'vyele ila iwe igaligwa na wasindila wabili ama wadatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Waja wogendelela kutenda vilozo wakomhokele haulongozi wa wanhu wose, giladi wavyele wayagwe wadumbe. <verse eid="1TI 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Haulongozi wa Mulungu na Kilisto Yesu na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wasaguligwe, nokulagiza kamba uzigoge ndagizi zino. Mtendele kila munhu ganogile, sambiumnogele munhu ino na kumwihila munhu iyagwe. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Sambiutende mbwisa kumwikila munhu makono sama ya kumsang'hanikila Mndewa. Sambiukiigele m'vilozo va wanhu wayagwe. Uiteganye sambiukiinyolodose.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Sambiung'we mazi geiyeka, ila ung'we divai kidogo sama ya inda yako na vitamu viukugula mianza bwando.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Vilozo va wanhu wayagwe vokoneka sambisambi, na vowalongola kuchola kuinhaguso. Ila vilozo va wanhu wayagwe vokoneka hamwande. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Na vivija, sang'hano zinogile zokoneka. Na hata sang'hano zija zinogile zileka kukoneka hazidaha kufisika.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Nyakadala wose wolondigwa kuwahishimila wandewa zao giladi twaga da Mulungu na mafundizo gake sambigalongigwe vihile. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Waja wali na wandewa wamtogole Kilisto sambiwaleke kuwalagusila hishima, kwavija hewo wao ndugu. Ila wawasang'hanikile hata vinogile ng'hani, kwavija wanhu wopata vinhu bwando kulawa mzisang'hano zao wao wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na wanogelwa zao.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1TI 6:2">Mafundizo ga Uvwizi na Ugoli wa Ikweli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Mbuli zino uzifundize na kuzigangamiza. <verse eid="1TI 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Munhu yoyose yofundiza mafundizo gayagwe, kogalema mafundizo ganogile ga kumtanga Mulungu, mafundo ga Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto, <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>munhu hiyo kana matopa na haduhu kinhu choyokitanga. Kana ngelegeza zihile za kusulukila kuibamilila na kuihasanya na wanhu sama ya nhegulo ya mbuli, avo kosongeza migongo, kugomba, kuilonga vihile, kuigelegeza vihile, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>na kuibamilila hagatigati ya wanhu wali na ngelegeza zihile na walibule ikweli mgati yao. Wanhu wano wogelegeza kamba kumtanga Mulungu iyo nzila ya kuwa mgoli.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Ila kumtanga Mulungu komtenda munhu yawe mgoli ng'hani, ihawa kokwiguta na kija kiyali nacho. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Kwavija hatwizile na kinhu chochose muulumwengu, na hatudaha kulawa na kinhu chochose. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Ila kamba tuhawa na mandia na vivalo, hatulondigwa kusulukila vinhu viyagwe. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Ila wanhu waja wolonda kuwa wagoli wogwila mkugezigwa na kunamata mumtego wa Mwenembago. Wogogigwa na sulukila bwando za ubozi na za kulumiza, azo ziwatenda wanhu wengile mzimbuli zihile na za ubananzi. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Kwavija kuzinogela hela kicho chanduso cha mbuli bwando zihile. Na wanhu wayagwe mkutamanila hela waileka nhamanila na kukiihoma wenyego na usungu mkulu.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi ha Timoteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Ila gweye, munhu wa Mulungu, inege na mbuli zino zose zihile. Iyohe kukala ukazi wa kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, kukala ukazi wa kumnogela Mulungu, kuwa na nhamanila, noge, mwazaganyo, na kuhola moyo. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Gomba ngomba inogile ya nhamanila. Unanahile ugima wa digunge uukemeligwe uutogole kulawa mmoyo haulongozi wa wasindila bwando. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Haulongozi wa Mulungu, ayo yowagwelela ugima wanhu wose, na haulongozi wa Kilisto Yesu, ayo viyakalile yosindila haulongozi wa Pontio Pilato kaiyalala vinogile, nokulagiza <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>uzigoge ndagizi zino bila uzenzeleganye ama kuwa na mbuli na munhu mbaka vondayagubuligwe Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto, <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>ayo Mulungu yondayamgale mkipigiti chake mwenyego. Mulungu yamotezwe, yali Mtawala yeiyeka, Mtawala wa watawala wa isi na Mndewa wa wandewa. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Heyo iyo yeiyeka yali na ugima wa digunge, yokala mgati ya mulangaza haudahika kukwenhukilwa, na haduhu munhu yamuwene ama yadahile kumona. Hishima na udaho viwe kumwake mazua gose. Amina.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Walagize waja wali wagoli muulumwengu uno wa sambi kamba sambiwakiitope ama kutamanila vinhu vao, avo vileka kutamanilwa, ila wamtamanile Mulungu, ayo yotugwelela vinhu vose giladi tuvideng'helele. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Walagize watende ganogile, wawe wagoli mkutenda sang'hano zinogile, wawe na moyo unogile, na watogole kuwasangila wanhu wayagwe vinhu vao. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Mkutenda vino, wokiikila wenyego ngama kamba msingi unogile sama ya kipigiti kikwiza, giladi waunanahile ugima uja uli ugima wa ikweli.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Timoteo, imiliza kija chuugweleligwe. Inege na mbamila zilekile kumnogela Mulungu na ngelegeza zihile, mkuhonyela zikemigwa “Ilimu.” <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Wayagwe waileka nhamanila yao mkuzitogola mbuli zino. Ngekewa ya Mulungu iwe hamoja na mweye mose.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
